commit 0b0ace4b532d0de3ee43f5891dfcdde17f7f5c00
Author: Robert N. M. Watson <robert.watson@cl.cam.ac.uk>
Date:   Sat Mar 20 23:21:37 2021 +0000

    Tune DTrace FBT provide aframes better on FreeBSD/arm64.
    
    By increasing aframes by one, we avoid the EL1 exception handler fielding
    the FBT-triggered trap appearing in every trace.
    
    MFC after:      3 days

diff --git a/sys/cddl/dev/fbt/aarch64/fbt_isa.c b/sys/cddl/dev/fbt/aarch64/fbt_isa.c
index f15bc12291d3..6bc351ad74f6 100644
